That can't break through the silence.

28
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,817
Feeling defeated?

29
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:51,037
It crushes your helpless heart.

30
00:01:51,120 --> 00:01:52,697
I've got your back, I swear.

31
00:01:52,780 --> 00:01:54,177
I'll always be here.

32
00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:57,960
Let's put our fate within
this light under the sun.

33
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:02,880
Can you close your eyes and
just listen to my voice?

34
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:08,777
Let's find the answer together I'm
telling you in our path I trust that it

35
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:14,437
will lead us To another sea untarded
Cause now we are home On the horizon,

36
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:16,167
out on the edge of the world

37
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:18,777
There is a place that I want to take you

38
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:22,080
to Let's head for it
then But after the way,

39
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:24,160
we already know

